# Script shell chay tren VPS Linux: giu LF ke ca khi checkout tren Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) de chep thang thu muc len server van chay duoc.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Git hook chay bang sh: CRLF lam hong dong shebang.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
# Ban va braces: noi dung phai trung byte voi tarball trong frontend/ va
# microservices/vendor (lockfile khoa integrity), nen khong doi xuong dong.
vendor/** -text
*.tgz binary
